iosMath
https://github.com/kostub/iosMath

vendor/iosMath, taken from commit b2b19a8 without its examples, tests and label views. Marky's changes:
- lib/MTMathListBuilder.m: adds \operatorname and \operatorname*.
- lib/MTMathAtomFactory.m: the aligned environment takes several right/left column pairs,
  as amsmath's align does.
- render/MTMathListDisplay.m: fractions without a rule (\binom, \atop) no longer draw a hairline.
- Loop counters changed to unsigned types, so the code builds without warnings.

The math table resources/fonts/latinmodern-math.plist comes from the same project (converted to a
binary property list).

